WEBVTT

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:25.870
Saint Seiya

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:33.000
The Underworld.

00:01:33.300 --> 00:01:36.080
The land of the dead, ruled by Hades.

00:01:36.350 --> 00:01:43.950
Young warriors of hope have entered
the Underworld in the name of peace.

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:52.470
God's punishment Greatest Eclipse

00:01:56.700 --> 00:01:59.630
Andromeda Shun, now as Lord Hades.

00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:04.570
Dragon Shiryu and Cygnus Hyoga
head to the Sixth Prison.

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:09.870
Fallen into the Ice Hell
of Cocytus, Pegasus Seiya.

00:02:10.710 --> 00:02:13.100
And in the Fifth Prison...

00:02:13.990 --> 00:02:17.730
The same attack doesn't
work twice on a Saint.

00:02:19.170 --> 00:02:21.070
Now, who's next?

00:02:23.940 --> 00:02:26.320
Do you think you've defeated Aiacos?

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:27.650
What?

00:02:37.730 --> 00:02:44.590
I see. I didn't think there would
be a Bronze Saint as strong as you.

00:02:45.570 --> 00:02:46.550
You bastard.

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:51.120
Fine, if the same attack
doesn't work twice on a Saint,

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:53.490
I'll bury you with this!

00:02:53.490 --> 00:02:54.220
Take this!

00:02:56.490 --> 00:02:59.150
Galactica Illusion!

00:03:09.820 --> 00:03:14.460
Canon, now I can finally finish you off.

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:19.930
Do you think you've defeated the Phoenix?

00:03:20.270 --> 00:03:21.350
What?

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:23.550
It can't be.

00:03:23.730 --> 00:03:27.240
I've fought Ikki before.

00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:31.680
No matter how many times he
fell, he stood back up again.

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:36.620
Like the phoenix, he gets
stronger with each resurrection.

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:48.250
Are you awake, Lord Hades?

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:51.870
I feel it. Pandora.

00:03:53.280 --> 00:03:57.830
What is this powerfully
aggressive Cosmo I feel?

00:03:58.320 --> 00:04:01.860
Yes, there is nothing for
you to be worried about.

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:08.270
A rat named Phoenix seems
to have burrowed his way in.

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:14.230
This Cosmo, hot like fire, is very nostalgic.

00:04:14.780 --> 00:04:17.880
Bring Phoenix here.

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:21.580
He becomes stronger with every resurrection?

00:04:22.830 --> 00:04:23.910
In that case.

00:04:24.220 --> 00:04:27.290
I'll make sure he never gets up again.

00:04:31.820 --> 00:04:35.120
No way. He is keeping up with my speed.

00:04:35.550 --> 00:04:41.140
Aiacos, I've closely observed
the speed of your attack.

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:44.630
To defeat you, I just have to be faster.

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:45.690
What?

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:52.310
What?

00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:54.690
What is this?

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:58.390
Is that the attack that's
supposed to outdo mine?

00:04:58.390 --> 00:05:00.700
It feels less than a mosquito bite.

00:05:01.430 --> 00:05:05.140
Now your death is certain.

00:05:05.140 --> 00:05:08.610
Take this! Galactica Illusion!

00:05:16.140 --> 00:05:19.890
How many times do I have to tell you
that the same attack doesn't work twice?

00:05:20.550 --> 00:05:21.830
It can't be.

00:05:21.870 --> 00:05:26.070
That's right. You shall
die by your own technique!

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:43.220
What was that?

00:05:43.810 --> 00:05:44.880
Aiacos!

00:05:44.880 --> 00:05:47.650
What just happened to Aiacos?

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:51.310
He unleashed the Phantom Devil.

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:55.870
How is it to see hell while in hell?

00:05:57.480 --> 00:05:58.750
Damn you!

00:05:58.750 --> 00:05:59.540
Enough.

00:06:00.930 --> 00:06:04.710
You are not strong enough to defeat me.

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:11.060
Nonsense! I'm one of the Big Three
out of a hundred and eight Specters.

00:06:11.060 --> 00:06:16.010
I will not be beaten by a lowly Bronze Saint!

00:06:16.790 --> 00:06:17.910
You leave me no choice.

00:06:18.470 --> 00:06:22.130
I'm worried about Athena and Shun.

00:06:22.220 --> 00:06:25.640
I don't have time to waste here.

00:06:25.800 --> 00:06:29.030
Take this! The Phoenix's flight
can destroy even the stars!

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:31.750
Flying Phoenix!

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:42.370
Aiacos!

00:06:45.950 --> 00:06:49.390
I can't believe it. Even
a man of his caliber.

00:06:49.580 --> 00:06:55.560
This fight was already determined when
Aiacos got hit with the Phantom Devil.

00:06:56.150 --> 00:07:02.960
It's a fearsome attack as it affects
not only the body but also the mind.

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:07.580
Now, will you two come at me together?

00:07:07.950 --> 00:07:08.820
What?

00:07:13.110 --> 00:07:13.950
What is going on?

00:07:15.690 --> 00:07:18.110
What is this?

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:19.640
My body!

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:29.180
He disappeared.

00:07:29.180 --> 00:07:30.950
Phoenix's body vanished.

00:07:31.620 --> 00:07:34.560
Impossible. Where did Ikki go?

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:53.020
Lord Hades, I have teleported
him from the Fifth Prison.

00:07:53.720 --> 00:07:57.670
This is the one emitting

00:07:57.720 --> 00:07:59.450
that strongly aggressive Cosmo.

00:08:01.840 --> 00:08:04.340
Where am I? What?

00:08:09.150 --> 00:08:10.450
Shun.

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:14.510
Shun!

00:08:14.630 --> 00:08:15.790
Don't move!

00:08:22.470 --> 00:08:23.840
Shun.

00:08:24.300 --> 00:08:30.490
Don't be so impertinent. He is
not your little brother anymore.

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:32.480
Ruler of the Underworld.

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:34.450
He is Lord Hades.

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:39.200
Ridiculous. I won't accept that!

00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:43.660
Ikki, you may have forgotten.

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:51.170
Your brother's body should have
melded into one with Lord Hades.

00:08:52.340 --> 00:08:53.460
What did you say?

00:08:54.440 --> 00:08:56.920
I can't blame you if you don't remember.

00:08:57.380 --> 00:09:02.160
Back then, I made sure
your memory would fade.

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:06.590
You can't even recall meeting me.

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:13.160
Fine, I will revive that memory for you.

00:09:18.880 --> 00:09:20.910
It's no use talking.

00:09:21.050 --> 00:09:23.750
Now, hand him over to me.

00:09:26.020 --> 00:09:27.480
What is this?

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:31.760
Shun's body, it's like
I'm holding electricity.

00:09:33.020 --> 00:09:36.240
You can't hold him much longer.

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:41.530
Now, let him go. Or else
your arms will be torn off.

00:09:42.260 --> 00:09:44.340
I will never let go!

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:50.540
I won't give up Shun if I lose both
my arms or even my whole body!

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:54.540
Then, as you wish.

00:10:10.180 --> 00:10:14.550
He's still not letting go despite his pain.

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:18.060
His determination is unwavering.

00:10:22.290 --> 00:10:24.290
Now, let's go.

00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:28.180
Until you grow old enough,

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:31.520
I will raise you as though
you are my little brother.

00:10:34.050 --> 00:10:36.160
What? What's this Cosmo?

00:10:39.650 --> 00:10:47.030
No way. Why can't I even lay a
finger on this defenseless infant?

00:10:50.220 --> 00:10:55.460
I won't let you take him!
Even if you kill me.

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:02.770
He's like fire.

00:11:02.980 --> 00:11:06.890
He's unconscious, but he continues
to protect his brother.

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:13.900
If we keep fighting, we run the risk
of damaging the body of Lord Hades.

00:11:16.810 --> 00:11:18.200
I have no choice.

00:11:18.200 --> 00:11:21.380
It will be another 10 years

00:11:21.380 --> 00:11:25.360
before Athena's seal breaks
and the Specters revive.

00:11:26.030 --> 00:11:27.030
Ikki.

00:11:27.510 --> 00:11:31.550
Until then, I will leave his body with you.

00:11:41.580 --> 00:11:44.320
But as long as he has that pendant,

00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:47.470
he will not be able to get away from me.

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:52.870
No matter where he hides, he'll be
pulled in by the soul of Lord Hades.

00:12:11.950 --> 00:12:14.510
Do you remember now, Phoenix?

00:12:14.620 --> 00:12:18.460
Remember? Is that the past I had forgotten?

00:12:21.790 --> 00:12:27.760
So the pendant that Shun wore was
mistaken as something from his mother?

00:12:28.150 --> 00:12:32.000
That was a leash to keep Shun close to Hades?

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:37.540
Exactly, it's written on the pendant.

00:12:37.890 --> 00:12:39.400
Yours ever.

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:41.540
I am forever yours.

00:12:41.980 --> 00:12:47.970
It means your brother's body
belongs to Lord Hades forever.

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:56.880
That's why when he appeared
in front of the Specters,

00:12:57.220 --> 00:12:59.570
the soul of Lord Hades took
over the body of your brother.

00:13:00.100 --> 00:13:05.340
As if he was waiting for the time when
the flesh and spirit would be one.

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:06.760
Shun.

00:13:07.490 --> 00:13:09.540
Didn't I say not to move?

00:13:15.660 --> 00:13:19.490
But it was a surprise even to me.

00:13:20.030 --> 00:13:23.440
The boy who was to become
the body of Lord Hades

00:13:23.580 --> 00:13:27.200
came to the Underworld as a Saint.

00:13:27.480 --> 00:13:33.720
No, he must have been lured
in by the soul of Lord Hades.

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:37.670
On the contrary.

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:41.550
Shun was not lured in by Hades.

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:44.660
He came here to defeat Hades himself!

00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:48.610
Shun was born to become a Saint.

00:13:48.610 --> 00:13:52.220
Not to become Hades!

00:13:52.270 --> 00:13:53.060
How dare you?

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:56.210
You still speak of nonsense!

00:13:57.710 --> 00:13:59.370
Take this, Hades!

00:14:02.170 --> 00:14:03.270
Lord Hades!

00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:08.460
Hades!

00:14:08.460 --> 00:14:12.770
The leash that has kept
Shun tethered is broken.

00:14:14.100 --> 00:14:17.880
Now, come out of Shun's body, Hades!

00:14:18.560 --> 00:14:21.370
If you won't, I'll drag you out.

00:14:22.030 --> 00:14:24.560
Fool! Know your place!

00:14:28.110 --> 00:14:32.070
Don't go any closer to
Lord Hades. Stand back!

00:14:38.720 --> 00:14:41.430
I'm not a feminist like Seiya and the others.

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:46.900
I don't show women mercy
even if they are an enemy.

00:14:47.530 --> 00:14:49.390
Stay back if you understand!

00:15:12.690 --> 00:15:13.370
What?

00:15:15.340 --> 00:15:16.100
Shun.

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:18.510
Open your eyes, Shun.

00:15:19.280 --> 00:15:21.980
Fool! How disrespectful!

00:15:22.580 --> 00:15:26.600
Stop it, Phoenix. Do you
know what you are doing?

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:29.710
Shun, it's me, Ikki.

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:32.270
How foolish.

00:15:33.590 --> 00:15:34.450
Shun.

00:15:34.720 --> 00:15:40.250
All you're doing is wounding
your brother's body.

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:41.470
What did you say?

00:15:41.600 --> 00:15:44.440
Stand back if you understand, Phoenix.

00:15:58.320 --> 00:16:01.410
You have committed numerous
acts of contempt against God.

00:16:01.410 --> 00:16:03.810
No punishment will suffice.

00:16:03.990 --> 00:16:06.860
I'll cut you up and feed
your body to the dead.

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:08.860
Die!

00:16:10.330 --> 00:16:11.240
Wait.

00:16:13.260 --> 00:16:17.360
I'm not finished with him.

00:16:18.150 --> 00:16:19.880
Don't interrupt.

00:16:22.050 --> 00:16:22.820
Yes.

00:16:23.550 --> 00:16:25.680
Listen carefully, Phoenix.

00:16:25.690 --> 00:16:29.960
No matter how hard you Saints
fight in the name of justice,

00:16:30.110 --> 00:16:32.000
it is futile.

00:16:32.290 --> 00:16:33.230
What?

00:16:33.920 --> 00:16:36.510
The world will go dark soon.

00:16:36.880 --> 00:16:40.200
It will never see sunlight again.

00:16:41.400 --> 00:16:45.110
What did you say? What do you mean?

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:48.120
Greatest Eclipse.

00:16:48.780 --> 00:16:51.830
Greatest Eclipse?

00:16:52.020 --> 00:16:54.780
Right. With my great powers,

00:16:55.220 --> 00:17:00.560
I have aligned the planets and
stars of the solar system.

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:05.850
That is the beginning of the ultimate
solar eclipse, the Greatest Eclipse.

00:17:06.950 --> 00:17:13.540
With my power, I will move
the moon in front of the sun.

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:18.020
The sun will never be seen from Earth again.

00:17:18.020 --> 00:17:20.020
It'll be an everlasting eclipse.

00:17:21.420 --> 00:17:26.990
The Earth will subsequently enter into
an Ice Age like a million years ago.

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:28.940
Vegetation will dry up.

00:17:29.230 --> 00:17:31.900
All organisms will die.

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:34.650
It will become a world of darkness.

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:39.880
By eliminating the sunlight,

00:17:39.880 --> 00:17:44.840
the Earth will become a land of the
dead. It will become the Underworld.

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:46.840
I can't believe it.

00:17:47.320 --> 00:17:49.800
Even Athena can't stop me.

00:17:50.370 --> 00:17:54.510
The Greatest Eclipse is about to commence.

00:17:54.810 --> 00:18:01.530
Phoenix, there is no need for any more
bloodshed. Just wait for death in peace.

00:18:02.150 --> 00:18:05.080
This Greatest Eclipse is nonsense!

00:18:05.420 --> 00:18:08.980
But if it is true, then I must do something!

00:18:09.280 --> 00:18:11.480
I told you it was futile.

00:18:11.480 --> 00:18:16.340
There is nothing a mere
mortal can do to stop it.

00:18:16.880 --> 00:18:23.050
It is because the Greatest Eclipse
is being controlled by God's will.

00:18:23.060 --> 00:18:26.030
Then I will destroy his will!

00:18:26.390 --> 00:18:27.280
What?

00:18:27.280 --> 00:18:30.250
By taking your life, Hades!

00:18:30.480 --> 00:18:34.770
Fool. You can't take the life of a God.

00:18:35.060 --> 00:18:39.550
If you attack me, you will only
wound your brother's body.

00:18:39.550 --> 00:18:41.130
How many times do I have to tell you?

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:47.950
Phoenix, will Andromeda die by your hands?

00:18:50.420 --> 00:18:51.600
Even so.

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:54.070
Yes, I have to!

00:18:54.440 --> 00:18:55.850
Take this, Hades!

00:18:56.670 --> 00:18:58.920
Flying Phoenix!

00:18:59.620 --> 00:19:01.070
What? Impossible!

00:19:16.330 --> 00:19:17.350
Lord Hades!

00:19:24.970 --> 00:19:25.900
What?

00:19:26.190 --> 00:19:29.610
I see. It's stronger than I heard.

00:19:29.610 --> 00:19:30.310
However,

00:19:30.760 --> 00:19:35.330
you can't kill me, much
less scratch me with that.

00:19:35.330 --> 00:19:37.320
You idiot!

00:19:37.590 --> 00:19:38.360
Die!

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:39.200
Stand back.

00:19:39.200 --> 00:19:40.230
Pandora.

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:43.880
Let Phoenix do as he wishes.

00:19:44.210 --> 00:19:47.200
This man was prepared to
die from the beginning.

00:19:49.370 --> 00:19:53.660
I wouldn't expect any less
from Andromeda's brother.

00:19:53.810 --> 00:19:58.350
Perhaps I should give him the
honor of killing him myself.

00:19:58.490 --> 00:20:00.390
Take it again!

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:03.430
Flying Phoenix!

00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:17.650
Bury Phoenix's body where it belongs.

00:20:25.730 --> 00:20:28.720
Impossible. Is this man immortal?

00:20:29.360 --> 00:20:32.550
I'm not convinced that
was the power of a God.

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:35.740
Are you pulling your punches, Hades?

00:20:37.820 --> 00:20:38.970
Or,

00:20:38.970 --> 00:20:40.710
is that all you have?

00:20:54.140 --> 00:20:58.110
What is going on? Why?

00:20:58.780 --> 00:21:01.860
The strength of Lord Hades is not enough!

00:21:14.880 --> 00:21:20.480
Fine. I will answer with force a
few thousand times more powerful.

00:21:21.010 --> 00:21:24.860
I will erase your existence
without leaving a trace.

00:21:29.740 --> 00:21:32.170
Vanish, Phoenix.

00:21:38.960 --> 00:21:44.710
What is going on? My body won't move!

00:21:49.410 --> 00:21:52.820
What? My hand is moving on its own.

00:21:54.950 --> 00:21:56.080
Lord Hades!

00:21:56.900 --> 00:21:58.230
This body

00:21:58.230 --> 00:22:02.330
is ignoring my mind and attacking me.

00:22:04.980 --> 00:22:06.050
Could it be...

00:22:09.250 --> 00:22:12.480
Shun. I can see Shun's soul!

00:22:13.050 --> 00:22:13.930
Brother.

00:22:14.850 --> 00:22:19.480
Brother, now is the only
chance to defeat Hades.

00:22:19.700 --> 00:22:25.790
Now, don't worry about my body
and blow the soul of Hades away!

00:22:26.520 --> 00:22:27.470
Shun.

00:24:03.650 --> 00:24:06.630
Shun sacrifices himself in an
attempt to save the Earth.

00:24:06.750 --> 00:24:08.720
In order to respond to his soul's cry,

00:24:08.720 --> 00:24:11.290
and to stop the Greatest
Eclipse from happening,

00:24:11.290 --> 00:24:12.680
Ikki throws a punch.

00:24:13.160 --> 00:24:15.930
His immense Cosmo
reaches as far as Cocytus.

00:24:16.730 --> 00:24:19.190
The flowing blood spreads across the floor.

00:24:19.760 --> 00:24:22.260
Ikki! You couldn't have...

00:24:22.720 --> 00:24:25.660
Saint Seiya: "Ikki! The Punch of Lament."

00:24:26.140 --> 00:24:28.740
Have you ever felt your Cosmo?
